    {
      "key": "rank",
      "name": "生成基础升温榜",
      "kind": "process",
      "description_zh": "近期增长速度排序，双榜允许重叠，增长是否加快另作解释。",
      "algorithm_zh": "当前量V、小时样本均值B、1h前量H：R=V/B，G=V/H−1；R>1且G>0入选，按G降序、R降序、asset_id升序取最多50。不排除最热榜资产，不读旧累计评分。2h历史可用时比较前段H/H2−1，变化=(G−前段)×100百分点，仅作加快/稳定/放缓解释，不参与排序；2h缺失不剔除。 资产档案asset_core.assets.created_at距请求时间不足7天标记is_new_asset，快照is_new同值；照常排名、不单排、不加分，显示「新币」。记录baseline_hours并显示基准时长，167小时及以上按满7天显示。",
      "algorithm_en": "Rank positive 1h growth above the daily seven-day baseline. Allow hottest overlap; acceleration is explanatory, never a ranking weight. Assets registered less than 7 days before the request are tagged is_new_asset (snapshot is_new), without ranking bonuses or separate ranking. Display baseline_hours and the new-asset tag.",
